.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論作者未寫出的想法\n(單選)","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].label#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論作者未寫出的想法","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].label#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(單選)","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"班長本來就該嚴厲，我不懂鄰兵為什麼哭","n":18,"ssz":".1............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿嬤對我的嚴厲，能幫助我適應軍中生活","n":18,"ssz":".............1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（從軍中回家見到阿嬤）把她風雨不透的抱離地面，轉了一個圈。","n":29,"ssz":"...............1..........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論作者未寫出的想法\n(3選2)","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].label#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(3選2)","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"藉此展現在部隊裡訓練出來的肌肉","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"很久沒有見到阿嬤，很高興再見到她","n":16,"ssz":"...........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不再是小孩了，現在不論身心，我都能輕易面對阿嬤","n":23,"ssz":"1........1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我試著講完全的尊重接納……並抗議她總是在嫌我罵我。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們的關係改變了，我不再怕她，可以提不同想法","n":22,"ssz":"..........1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我進入了反抗期，對什麼都不滿意，都